---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import MedicalDisclaimer from '../components/MedicalDisclaimer.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import authorPhoto from '../assets/denis-ethier.png';
import CardinalNetworkDiagram from '../components/CardinalNetworkDiagram.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead 
			title="My Message to Researchers | Decoding The Burn" 
			description="Open patient datasets, multi-variable phenotyping, and collaborative time-series data for Burning Mouth Syndrome researchers." 
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="hero-centered-wrapper">
				<div class="hero-centered-header">
					<MedicalDisclaimer />
				</div>

				<!-- Author Photo on Top -->
				<div class="hero-video-centered">
					<div class="video-placeholder-wrapper" style="cursor: default;">
						<Image 
							src={authorPhoto} 
							alt="Denis Ethier - Message to Researchers" 
							class="video-placeholder-img" 
							width={1400} 
							height={788} 
						/>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Message to Researchers Section -->
				<article class="personal-story-section">
					<h2 class="story-heading">My Message to Researchers</h2>
					<div class="story-lead">
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							If you are a clinical or academic researcher studying oral neuropathic pain, Burning Mouth Syndrome, or mucosal physiology, I would love to hear from you.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							I want to help you spread the message about your research and clinical findings, even if your study is still in progress or preliminary. If you have active research, data, or hypotheses, let me know. I will happily create a dedicated post, feature your work across our channels, and share it with our growing community of patients and clinicians.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							In my own journey, I managed to reduce my BMS pain from a debilitating 10/10 down to 0 with a carnivore diet, what is essentially a no-acid diet. Through extensive self-experimentation, dietary and environmental acids have consistently shown up as the direct mechanical and chemical trigger for my pain spikes. If anyone in the research world is currently investigating the connection between oral burning sensations, exposed dentinal tubules, and acid-induced neuropathic responses, I would love to connect and learn more about your findings.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							If you are looking for research directions, real-world case observations, or want to bounce ideas regarding potential variables to study, please feel free to reach out. I am active on social media and easily reachable through our <a href="/contact" class="inline-story-link">contact page</a>.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							Furthermore, if you are conducting clinical trials or observational studies and need participant data, I am very open to participating in research studies and testing structured protocols, subject to my health and ongoing conditions.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							I firmly believe that the key to accelerating discoveries is bringing patients, medical doctors, dentists, and researchers together into an open loop of shared data. That collaborative bridge is the core of <a href="/mission" class="inline-story-link">My Mission</a> and our <a href="/open-science" class="inline-story-link">Open Science</a> commitment.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Collaborative Cardinal Network Diagram -->
					<div class="network-diagram-container">
						<h3 class="diagram-section-title">Bridging Patients, Clinicians &amp;&nbsp;Data</h3>
						<p class="diagram-section-subtitle">
							Real breakthroughs happen when patient observations, dental mechanics, medical diagnostics, and laboratory research connect around open&nbsp;data.
						</p>
						<CardinalNetworkDiagram />
					</div>

					<!-- Direct Collaboration CTA -->
					<div class="collab-cta-box">
						<h3 class="collab-cta-title">Are you conducting research on BMS or neuropathic pain?</h3>
						<p class="collab-cta-text">
							Whether you have a paper to highlight, want to bounce research ideas, or are looking for study participants, let's connect.
						</p>
						<div class="collab-cta-actions">
							<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.hero-centered-wrapper {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
	}

	.hero-centered-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
	}

	.hero-centered-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.hero-video-centered {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto 3rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08));
		background: #000000;
	}

	.video-placeholder-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.video-placeholder-img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	.personal-story-section {
		background: var(--bg-card, #ffffff);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e2e8f0);
		border-radius: 24px;
		padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
	}

	.story-heading {
		font-size: 1.85rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.story-lead {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
	}

	.story-paragraph {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.inline-story-link {
		color: #be123c;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
		transition: color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.inline-story-link:hover {
		color: #9f1239;
	}

	.network-diagram-container {
		margin: 3.5rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.diagram-section-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.diagram-section-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.collab-cta-box {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1136 0%, #0d081a 100%);
		border-radius: 18px;
		padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		color: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
	}

	.collab-cta-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #ffffff;
		line-height: 1.35;
		margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.collab-cta-text {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #e2e8f0;
		max-width: 620px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.collab-cta-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c8382c 0%, #991b1b 100%);
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		filter: brightness(1.1);
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
		color: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.btn-secondary:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.personal-story-section {
			padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
